# QA Agent — Modes & security

## Modes

- `plan-only`: QA Agent prepares Claude input → Claude CLI Action step → validate (+1 repair via second Claude CLI Action step) → PR comment. Job stays green if generation/validation succeeds.
- `plan-and-run`: same planning path → run P0 → PR comment. Fail the job if any P0 fails.

## Artifacts

- Always save Claude CLI Action **input** and **output** as artifacts.
- In `plan-and-run`, also save runner screenshots/logs as artifacts.

## Security & config

- Secrets only from GitHub Secrets; never hardcode keys.
- Pass `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` only into the Claude CLI Action step.
- Require `base-url` for runs; optional staging auth via secrets/inputs.
- Do not log secrets or full unredacted Claude output.
